#: kwrite.cpp:148
msgid "Use this command to close the current document"
msgstr "Siervoz vs di cisse comande po clôre li documint do moumint."

#: kwrite.cpp:153
msgid "Use this command to create a new document"
msgstr "Eployîz cisse comande ci po fé on novea documint."

#: kwrite.cpp:155
msgid "Use this command to open an existing document for editing"
msgstr "Eployîz cisse comande po drovi ey aspougnî on documint k' i gn a"

#: kwrite.cpp:159
msgid ""
"This lists files which you have opened recently, and allows you to easily "
"open them again."
msgstr ""
"Çoula mostere ene djivêye des fitchîs ki vos avoz dierinnmint drovou, et vs "
"permete delzès rdrovi åjheymint."

#: kwrite.cpp:163
msgid "&New Window"
msgstr "&Novele finiesse"

#: kwrite.cpp:165
msgid "Create another view containing the current document"
msgstr "Ahiver ene novele vuwe avou l' documint do moumint"

#: kwrite.cpp:168
msgid "Close the current document view"
msgstr "Clôre li vuwe do documint do moumint"

#: kwrite.cpp:177
msgid "Use this command to show or hide the view's statusbar"
msgstr "Eployî cisse comande po mostrer ou catchî l' bår d' estat del vuwe"

#: kwrite.cpp:179
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Sho&w Path"
msgid "Sho&w Path in Titlebar"
msgstr "Mostrer l' &tchimin"

#: kwrite.cpp:182
msgid "Show the complete document path in the window caption"
msgstr "Mostere tot l' tchimin do documint el finiesse"

#: kwrite.cpp:185
msgid "Configure the application's keyboard shortcut assignments."
msgstr "Apontyî les aroyaedjes des rascourti programe del taprece."

#: kwrite.cpp:189
msgid "Configure which items should appear in the toolbar(s)."
msgstr "Aponteye kés cayets duvrént aparete el båre(s) ås usteye."

#: kwrite.cpp:192
msgid "&About Editor Component"
msgstr "Å&d fwait do componint aspougneu"

#: kwrite.cpp:245
msgid "Open File"
msgstr "Drovi fitchî"

#: kwrite.cpp:260
msgid ""
"The file given could not be read; check whether it exists or is readable for "
"the current user."
msgstr ""
"Dji n' a nén savou lére li fitchî dné; verifyîz s' il egzistêye eyet s' il "
"est léjhåve po l' uzeu do moumint."

